-- Migration 55 down: remove the K.4 first-class `external_ids` field on entity.
--
-- Only the `external_ids` field is owned by migration 55. The `reference_entity`
-- table, its fields, and `idx_ref_name` predate it (migration 41), so the
-- down-migration does NOT drop them (dropping them would regress migration 41's
-- schema and discard loaded vocabulary). Removing `external_ids` is a clean
-- reverse of the single field 55 introduced. Idempotent: IF EXISTS makes re-run
-- a no-op.

REMOVE FIELD IF EXISTS external_ids ON entity;
